                "text": "House Democrats are united behind saving health care and hearing the stories of the American people.\n\nEveryone should be able to see a doctor when they need one\u2014and not have to skip rent payments to keep their insurance.\n\nRepublican leadership is still nowhere to be seen. https://t.co/Mz8gH1kaLh",
