                "text": "Can you afford a massive premium spike? Let's look at the numbers for a minute.\n\nIf Republicans don't work with us to fund the government with a bill that protects health care,  Americans relying on the Affordable Care Act will see their costs for next year go through the roof. https://t.co/X9Eo2eF2up",
