                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The rising costs of health care imposed by Republicans in Congress and the Trump Administration are putting undue burdens on the American people.\n\nI joined my colleagues in @TheBlackCaucus to share stories from Georgia.\nhttps://t.co/QO74lgot5S https://t.co/yLWVTJReyC",
