                "reply_count": 1,
                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The Republican-led legislation before the House does not address the rising costs of health care that are burdening American families.\n\nAs a two-time breast cancer survivor navigating additional health challenges in my own family, I know firsthand how access, affordability, and care determine outcomes.",
